	<section_number>15.2-6303</section_number>
	<catch_line>Authorities to file annual reports</catch_line>
	<text>
		At least once a year, each authority shall file with the Governor a report of its activities for the preceding year.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-940; 1954, c. 645; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-1323; 1997, c. 587.</history>
